Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790164799999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790121599999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The largest single structure in the window is a range, not a trend: ~65 bars inside 1512.91-1974.46 plus 25 bars inside 2357.18-2680.00, i.e. two-sided overlap occupies most of the 120 bars.", "The push above 2357.18-2680.00 is a second attempt: the 1789084800000 bar spiked to 2680.00 and closed 2514.72, then price fell to 2358.62 before rallying, and first breakouts from ranges often fail.", "The last leg covers 2358.62 to 2850.00 (+20.8%) in six bars, and the 208.30-range and 445.69-range bars late in an extended move are climactic-sized; such bars can mark exhaustion rather than a fresh trend leg.", "The final bar 1790035200000 is an inside bar closing 2752.43 below the prior close, so no additional close above 2775.61/2850.00 yet confirms acceptance of the new high."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing lows across the window (1368.42 -> 1512.91 -> 1821.49/1821.69 -> 2357.18/2358.62) with higher swing highs (1845.09 -> 1974.46 -> 2771 -> 2850.00).", "Six consecutive higher closes (1789516800000-1789948800000) after the 2358.62 test of the range low, ending with a large bull trend bar closing 2775.61 above every prior high in the window.", "The 1787097600000 break of the 1512.91-1974.46 range was followed by a spike to 2771.00, so the current push repeats a visible breakout-consolidation-new-high sequence on this window.", "The 1789948800000 bar closes in the upper quarter of its 208.30 range, and the following bar holds inside it rather than reversing, so the breakout has not been rejected so far."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed D1 bars (1779753600000-1790121599999): window opens at 2109.85, last close 2752.43, window low 1368.42, window high 2850.00.", "Bars from 1779753600000 to 1780704000000 declined from 2138.82 to 1368.42; the last three of that leg are wide bear bars (ranges 230.76, 237.00, 230.85) and the 1780704000000 bar closes 1568.55, well above its 1368.42 low.", "The 1780790400000 bar is a bull reversal bar: open 1568.55, high 1690.78, low 1563.52, close 1687.83, closing in its top quarter.", "About 65 bars (1781481600000-1787097599999) overlap two-sided between 1512.91 (low, 1782432000000) and 1974.46 (high, 1785110400000), with repeated failed pushes at 1944.72, 1954.36, 1959.37, 1974.46 and repeated holds near 1821.49/1821.69.", "The 1787097600000 bar is a very large bull bar (1905.63-2293.80, close 2252.16) that breaks above 1974.46; the 1787270400000 bar has the widest range in the window (2325.31-2771.00 = 445.69) and closes 2515.30, mid-range.", "The next 25 bars (1787356800000-1789516799999) overlap between 2357.18 (low, 1788307200000) and 2680.00 (high, 1789084800000), with most bars between roughly 2394 and 2558; the bar at 1789430400000 tests 2358.62, holding just above 2357.18.", "Six consecutive higher closes follow (1789516800000-1789948800000), ending with a large bull trend bar (2641.70-2850.00, close 2775.61) that closes above every prior high in the window.", "The final bar (1790035200000) is an inside bar (2716.01-2776.18) closing 2752.43, just below the prior close 2775.61 and below the 2850.00 high."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Sell climax into 1368.42: three consecutive wide bear bars (1780531200000-1780790399999) end the decline from the window open, closed by the bull reversal bar at 1780790400000 (close 1687.83 near its high).", "end_time_ms": 1780876799999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780531200000, "upper_boundary": null}, {"description": "Broad two-sided trading range after the reversal: about 65 bars overlapping between 1512.91 and 1974.46, with repeated failed breaks of both edges (1944.72/1954.36/1959.37/1974.46 on top; 1821.49/1821.69/1512.91 below) and heavy bar overlap.", "end_time_ms": 1787097599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1781481600000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the long range: bar at 1787097600000 (1905.63-2293.80) breaks 1974.46, and two bars later the 1787270400000 bar reaches 2771.00 with a mid-range close after a 445.69 range (climactic-sized).", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Trading range after the spike: 25 overlapping bars between 2357.18 and 2680.00, most of them inside roughly 2394-2558; a 2680.00 spike on 1789084800000 closes back at 2514.72 and price returns to 2358.62 on 1789430400000.", "end_time_ms": 1789516799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2680"}, {"description": "Current bull leg: higher low at 2358.62 (1789430400000) held above the range low, then six consecutive higher closes and a large bull trend bar (1789948800000) to a new window high 2850.00; the last bar is an inside pause bar.", "end_time_ms": 1790121599999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2850.00, or a pullback holding above the 2680.00-2700.00 breakout area followed by a new high, keeps the breakout-spike bull read.", "Failed breakout: a close back below 2557.46 (the 1787788800000 range high) puts price inside the 2357.18-2680.00 range and shifts the read toward trading-range.", "Loss of the higher low at 2357.18-2358.62 turns directional pressure from bull to at least balanced and makes 2771-2850.00 a possible failed-breakout high.", "Repeated overlapping bars with deepening pullbacks that stay below 2775-2850.00 would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": false, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790150399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The 2850 extreme (1789977600000) sits 126.85 points above that bar's close and is an exact round number; follow-through bars topped at 2795 and 2804.59, so the breakout above the 2700 double top was not accepted.", "The last 12 bars are two-sided overlap with no new high above 2804.59 in the final 8 bars, so the immediate leg reads range-like rather than a clean continuing channel.", "The final bar closes 2741.96, near its low of 2737.35 and below the 2772.99 open, showing short-term bear pressure at the top of the consolidation.", "The full window also contains a 42-bar range (2411.04-2528.8) and a bear leg from 2609.02 to 2358.62, so a broader 2358.62-2850 range remains a legitimate alternative frame for the same bars."], "evidence_for": ["Since 2358.62 (1789488000000) the sequence is unbroken: higher highs at 2585.5, 2643.52, 2700 and 2850, higher lows at 2370.54, 2568.16 and 2716.01, with no prior swing low violated.", "Wide bull bars close near their highs (1789732800000 closed 2578.6 after a 2507.15 open; 1789977600000 closed 2723.15, above the 2700 highs of 1789804800000 and 1789948800000).", "The 12-bar pause holds above 2716.01, the most recent higher low, and the final close 2741.96 remains above the 2700 breakout area, so structure has not been broken to the downside.", "The pause is small (2716.01-2804.59, about 3.2%) relative to the roughly 490-point leg from 2358.62 to 2850, and it follows a strong bull spike, which fits a bull-flag pullback inside a channel rather than a completed reversal."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens 2395.48 (1788422400000) and closes 2741.96; window high 2850 and window low 2358.62 both print in the second half of the window.", "Higher highs since the low: 2585.5 (1789732800000), 2643.52 (1789747200000), 2700 (1789804800000 and 1789948800000), 2850 (1789977600000); higher lows: 2370.54 (1789574400000), 2568.16 (1789891200000), 2716.01 (1790049600000).", "Bull bodies dominate the up leg, e.g. 1789732800000 2507.15 to 2578.6, 1789747200000 2579.97 to 2636.28, 1789977600000 2658.81 to 2723.15.", "Bar 1789977600000 spans 2658.06-2850 and closes 2723.15, a 126.85-point upper tail; the earlier spike bar 1789128000000 reached 2680 and closed 2555.52 with a similar long upper tail.", "The last 12 bars (1789977600000-1790136000000) overlap between 2716.01 and 2804.59; no high above 2804.59 after bar 1790020800000.", "Final bar 1790136000000: open 2772.99, high 2786.81, low 2737.35, close 2741.96, a bear bar closing in the lower third of its range and inside the prior bars' range.", "Earlier context is two-sided: bars 1788523200000-1789113600000 spanned a 42-bar range 2411.04-2528.8, and bars 1789416000000-1789488000000 sold off from 2609.02 to 2358.62."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bull leg from the 2358.62 low (1789488000000) to the 2850 high (1789977600000): roughly 34 bars of higher highs and higher lows with overlapping pullbacks to 2568.16 and 2716.01 and several wide bull trend bars; the current 12-bar sideways overlap at the top is the latest pullback inside this channel.", "end_time_ms": 1789977600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Two-sided 12-bar consolidation at the trend high between the 2804.59 high (1790020800000) and the 2716.01 low (1790049600000); highs capped under 2804.59 with slightly rising lows after 1790049600000, i.e. a pause / possible bull flag, not yet a resolved range.", "end_time_ms": 1790136000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2716.01", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Spike bar 1789977600000: range 2658.06-2850 with a 126.85-point upper tail and a close at 2723.15, an exact round-number extreme like the earlier 2680 spike at 1789128000000. Follow-through stopped at 2795 (1789992000000) and 2804.59 (1790020800000); this names a possible buy climax, not a confirmed reversal.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Bear leg from the 2609.02 high (1789416000000) to the 2358.62 low (1789488000000), including two large bear bars (1789473600000 2475.02 to 2423.29; 1789488000000 2423.22 to 2412.95 with the 2358.62 low); the whole leg was later retraced by the bull channel.", "end_time_ms": 1789488000000, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Earlier 42-bar two-sided range (1788523200000-1789113600000) between 2411.04 and 2528.8, broken by the 2680 spike at 1789128000000; it is the window's dominant character before the current bull leg.", "end_time_ms": 1789113600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788523200000, "upper_boundary": "2528.8"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bull continuation: a close above 2804.59 (1790020800000) with follow-through above 2850 would reassert the channel and mark a fresh breakout leg.", "Consolidation resolution: acceptance above 2804.59 or below 2716.01 with a following bar in the same direction resolves the 12-bar pause; repeated closes back inside 2716.01-2804.59 keep it intact.", "Trend damage: a close below 2716.01 followed by a lower high under 2804.59 would shift the read toward trading-range (2658.06-2850) or transition-unclear and would end the always-in-long state.", "Climax confirmation: failure back below 2700 with a close under 2658.06 (1789977600000 low) would strengthen the buy-climax / failed-breakout reading over the channel reading.", "Continued higher lows above 2716.01 and a new high above 2850 would keep the bull channel as the dominant description."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "stale"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2500.74", "close_time_ms": 1789736399999, "high": "2508.53", "low": "2500.14", "open": "2507.15", "open_time_ms": 1789732800000, "volume": "2023982.008"}, {"close": "2557.24", "close_time_ms": 1789739999999, "high": "2567.43", "low": "2495.82", "open": "2500.73", "open_time_ms": 1789736400000, "volume": "2947078.83"}, {"close": "2578", "close_time_ms": 1789743599999, "high": "2579.15", "low": "2535.1", "open": "2564.99", "open_time_ms": 1789740000000, "volume": "2129890.799"}, {"close": "2578.6", "close_time_ms": 1789747199999, "high": "2585.5", "low": "2569.16", "open": "2578", "open_time_ms": 1789743600000, "volume": "2298367.627"}, {"close": "2596.45", "close_time_ms": 1789750799999, "high": "2605.57", "low": "2578.44", "open": "2579.97", "open_time_ms": 1789747200000, "volume": "2231312.238"}, {"close": "2605.5", "close_time_ms": 1789754399999, "high": "2606.24", "low": "2585.2", "open": "2596.45", "open_time_ms": 1789750800000, "volume": "2348369.001"}, {"close": "2611.28", "close_time_ms": 1789757999999, "high": "2619.57", "low": "2601.86", "open": "2605.5", "open_time_ms": 1789754400000, "volume": "2318522.655"}, {"close": "2636.28", "close_time_ms": 1789761599999, "high": "2643.52", "low": "2609.14", "open": "2611.27", "open_time_ms": 1789758000000, "volume": "1991110.929"}, {"close": "2629.84", "close_time_ms": 1789765199999, "high": "2637.08", "low": "2625.21", "open": "2636.81", "open_time_ms": 1789761600000, "volume": "2034163.499"}, {"close": "2625.85", "close_time_ms": 1789768799999, "high": "2638.49", "low": "2625.01", "open": "2629.84", "open_time_ms": 1789765200000, "volume": "20037